{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sipodoro API",
    "description": "API Documentation for Sipodoro — a Pomodoro-based productivity app with gamification (coins, flowers, garden, streaks) and hydration tracking.\n\n## Authentication\n- Most endpoints require a JWT token in the `Authorization` header: `Bearer {{auth_token}}`\n- To get a token, use the **Login** or **Register** endpoint\n- The token expires in 1 day\n\n## Base URL\n- Default: `http://localhost:5000`\n- You can change the `base_url` variable for different environments\n\n## Environment Variables\n| Variable | Description | Default |\n|---|---|---|\n| `base_url` | Base URL of the API | `http://localhost:5000` |\n| `auth_token` | JWT token (set after login) | *(empty)* |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": [""]
            },
            "description": "Root health check endpoint. Returns a confirmation that the backend is running."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Sipodoro backend running!\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Root health check endpoint."
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"johndoe\",\n  \"email\": \"johndoe@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"securePassword123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new user account.\n\n**Notes:**\n- `username` must be unique\n- `email` must be unique; if set to `admin@sipodoro.com`, role becomes `admin`\n- On success, also creates a CoinWallet, Garden, and Streak record for the user"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"User registered successfully\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"user_id\": 1,\n    \"username\": \"johndoe\",\n    \"email\": \"johndoe@example.com\",\n    \"role\": \"user\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"johndoe@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"securePassword123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login with email or username and password. Returns a JWT token.\n\n**Note:** The `email` field accepts either an email address OR a username.\n\n**After login:** Copy the `token` value from the response and set it as the `auth_token` environment variable in Postman."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Login successful\",\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"user_id\": 1,\n    \"username\": \"johndoe\",\n    \"email\": \"johndoe@example.com\",\n    \"role\": \"user\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/auth/profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/profile",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Get the authenticated user's profile information (from the JWT token)."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"user\": {\n    \"user_id\": 1,\n    \"username\": \"johndoe\",\n    \"email\": \"johndoe@example.com\",\n    \"role\": \"user\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/auth/logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Logout the current user. Note: This is a client-side logout — the server does not invalidate the token. Simply delete the token on the client side."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Logged out successfully\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Authentication endpoints — register, login, profile, and logout."
    },
